[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 22020.47, "timestamp": "06:07:00", "text": "需要截屏并保存"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22022.788, "timestamp": "06:07:02", "text": "浏览我的画廊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22033.19, "timestamp": "06:07:13", "text": "感觉有点复杂。不会。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22035.51, "timestamp": "06:07:15", "text": "你不需要那个。两者都很复杂。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22038.03, "timestamp": "06:07:18", "text": "嗯，那就是我。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22046.628, "timestamp": "06:07:26", "text": "等等，我们什么时候才能有自己的房子？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22048.948, "timestamp": "06:07:28", "text": "地点？正如你所说，现在你将去做"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22051.43, "timestamp": "06:07:31", "text": "大概就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22053.59, "timestamp": "06:07:33", "text": "就像我当时那样。是的，我当时正在做"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22056.628, "timestamp": "06:07:36", "text": "那。但问题是，如果我只添加一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22060.07, "timestamp": "06:07:40", "text": "实现方法之一是使用类似地图的模组。但"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22062.31, "timestamp": "06:07:42", "text": "每个人都能找到其他"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22064.788, "timestamp": "06:07:44", "text": "玩家。哦，不。我们不希望那样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22071.83, "timestamp": "06:07:51", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22075.07, "timestamp": "06:07:55", "text": "你还计划添加其他模组吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22078.39, "timestamp": "06:07:58", "text": "我敢肯定。"}]